{"engine": "gold", "source": "My location on the app seems to be pinned to a completely different area than where I actually am.", "output": "App-la enoda location naan actual-a irukura area vida completely vera area-la pin aayirukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.533, "english_ratio": 0.467}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:57.974391+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The estimated arrival time keeps changing every few seconds, so I'm not sure how long I should actually wait.", "output": "Estimated arrival time konja nimishathukku onnu maari maari irukku, so exact-a evlo neram wait pannanum nu theriyala.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 16, "tamil_ratio": 0.688, "english_ratio": 0.312}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.006547+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Since the road is completely flooded near the underpass, could you take an alternate route to avoid it?", "output": "Underpass pakkathula road completely flood aayirukurathunaala, adha avoid panna alternate route edunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 6, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 12, "tamil_ratio": 0.5, "english_ratio": 0.5}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.049094+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "This is somewhat urgent since I have a flight to catch in an hour, so please try to take the fastest route possible.", "output": "Idhu konjam urgent, oru mani neram-la enakku flight irukku, so mudinjavarai fastest route-a edunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.714, "english_ratio": 0.286}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.091346+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Thank you so much for waiting patiently, I really appreciate you accommodating the delay on my end.", "output": "Patience-a wait pannadhukku romba nandri, enoda delay-a accommodate pannadhukku really appreciate pannuren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 12, "tamil_ratio": 0.667, "english_ratio": 0.333}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.143194+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I hope the rest of your day goes smoothly, and thanks again for getting me here safely despite the traffic.", "output": "Unga naeku baaki nalla poga vendum nu nenaikuren, traffic-la irundhalum enna safe-a kuttitu vandhadhukku romba nandri.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 16, "english_tokens": 1, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 17, "tamil_ratio": 0.941, "english_ratio": 0.059}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.180072+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Brother, before you start the meter, could you confirm once whether you're taking the flyover or the ground route, since the fare changes depending on that?", "output": "Anna, meter start pannadhukku munnadi, flyover-a edukkardhu illa ground route-a edukkardhu nu oru thadava confirm pannunga, adha vachu fare change aagum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 12, "english_tokens": 9, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 21, "tamil_ratio": 0.571, "english_ratio": 0.429}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.313674+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Brother, I noticed the fuel gauge is showing quite low, so if you need to stop at a petrol bunk on the way, please let me know in advance so I'm not surprised by the delay.", "output": "Anna, fuel gauge romba kammi-a kaattura maadhiri paakuren, so vazhila petrol bunk-la nikkanum na, munnadiye sollunga, delay-a paathu naan surprise aagama irukalam.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 16, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 22, "tamil_ratio": 0.727, "english_ratio": 0.273}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.381554+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Brother, since it's already quite late and the streets are mostly empty, would it be okay to skip the usual route and take the highway instead, just to save some time?", "output": "Anna, already romba raathiri aayidichu, streets-um mostly empty-a irukku, so usual route-a skip pannitu highway-a edukalama, konjam time save aagum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 11, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 20, "tamil_ratio": 0.45, "english_ratio": 0.55}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.418461+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Brother, I know the meter is showing a different amount, but the app already confirmed a fixed price for this trip, so please go by that instead", "output": "Anna, meter-la vera amount kaattuthu nu enakku theriyum, aana app already indha trip-ku fixed price confirm pannitrukku, so andha price-a follow pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 12, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 23, "tamil_ratio": 0.478, "english_ratio": 0.522}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:58.881993+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Brother, please don't take the route the app is showing right now, since there's a religious procession blocking that entire street for the next hour.", "output": "Anna, app sollara route-a follow pannadheenga, andha street-a procession-nala adutha oru mani neramukku block pannirukanga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 16, "tamil_ratio": 0.562, "english_ratio": 0.438}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:59.265256+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Uncle, I can see three cars matching that description near the gate, so could you flash your indicator once so I know which one is yours?", "output": "Uncle, gate pakkathula sonna description-ku match aagura moonu car-a naan paakuren, so unga vandi edhu nu theriyuradhukku oru thadava indicator flash pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 15, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 22, "tamil_ratio": 0.682, "english_ratio": 0.318}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:59.361376+00:00"}
{"engine": "offline-lexicon", "source": "Your OTP is 4821", "output": "உங்க OTP is 4821", "meaning_ok": false, "hard_flags": ["tamil_script_mixed"], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": ["mix:not_tanglish", "mix:too_short", "mix:tamil_ratio_low:0.00", "mix:english_ratio_high:1.00"], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 0, "english_tokens": 1, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 1, "tamil_ratio": 0.0, "english_ratio": 1.0}, "ok": false, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:21:59.466468+00:00"}
