{"engine": "gold", "source": "I know this is a bit of a strange request, but could you please turn off the AC for a few minutes, since one of the passengers just got a bit too cold?", "output": "Idhu konjam strange request nu enakku theriyum, aana konja neramaachum AC-a off pannunga, passenger onnu konjam over-a cold aayirukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_dropped:minutes"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 8, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 19, "tamil_ratio": 0.579, "english_ratio": 0.421}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:22:11.742896+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Brother, I know the meter is showing a different amount, but the app already confirmed a fixed price for this trip, so please go by that instead.", "output": "Anna, meter-la vera amount kaattuthu nu enakku theriyum, aana app already indha trip-ku fixed price confirm pannitrukku, so andha price-a follow pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 12, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 23, "tamil_ratio": 0.478, "english_ratio": 0.522}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:22:11.779418+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I'm currently standing near the security gate outside the apartment complex, but since there are two entrances on this road, please ask the driver to confirm which side he's coming from before he gets confused and goes to the wrong gate.", "output": "Naan ipo apartment complex veliye security gate pakkathula nikkuren, aana indha road-la rendu entrance irukkurathunala, driver confuse aagi thappu gate-ku poaradhukku munnadi, avaru eppadi vara pora nu confirm pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 21, "english_tokens": 10, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 31, "tamil_ratio": 0.677, "english_ratio": 0.323}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:22:11.834576+00:00"}
