{"engine": "gold", "source": "I am standing near the security gate with a red suitcase.", "output": "Naan security gate pakkathula red suitcase-oda nikkiren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 4, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 8, "tamil_ratio": 0.5, "english_ratio": 0.5}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:22:11.981027+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The app is showing that my driver has already reached the pickup point, but I've been standing outside for the last ten minutes and I don't see any car nearby, so I think either the GPS is showing the wrong location or he's waiting at a completely different gate.", "output": "App-la enoda driver already pickup point-ku vandhuduchu nu kaattuthu, aana naan kadaisi pathu nimisham-a veliye nikkuren, romba nerama pakkathula oru vandi kooda kaanom, so ippadi thonuthu, GPS thappu location kaattuthu illana avaru vera edho gate-la wait pannuraru nu.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_dropped:arrive", "name_missing:i've"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 30, "english_tokens": 10, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 40, "tamil_ratio": 0.75, "english_ratio": 0.25}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.248157+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Since it's raining heavily right now and the traffic near the flyover is completely blocked because of a diversion, I think it would be better if the driver takes the inner road route instead of the main road, even if it takes a few extra minutes, because at least we won't be stuck for an hour.", "output": "Ippo romba mazhai peiyurathunaalum, flyover pakkathula diversion irukkurathunaalum traffic completely block aagi iruku, so driver main road-a vidama inner road route-la po nu naan nenaikkuren, konjam extra nimisham aanalum paravaila, ella onnu mani neram jam-la nikkama irukalam.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 25, "english_tokens": 13, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 38, "tamil_ratio": 0.658, "english_ratio": 0.342}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.263940+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I know I gave you the wrong drop location earlier by mistake, and I'm really sorry for the confusion, but if it's possible, could you please ask the driver to take a U-turn at the next signal and come back to the correct building, which is actually just two minutes away from where we currently are?", "output": "Naan mudhalla thappu drop location kudutten nu enakku theriyum, andha confusion-ku romba sorry, aana mudinjaa, adutha signal-la driver U-turn edukkanum nu sollunga, correct building-ku thirumba vaanga, adhu ippo naanga irukura idathula irundhu rendu nimisham dhooram thaan.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 29, "english_tokens": 10, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 39, "tamil_ratio": 0.744, "english_ratio": 0.256}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.285202+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Even though the fare shown in the app before the ride started was around two hundred rupees, the driver is now saying that because of the surge pricing and the toll charges on this route, the final amount will be almost double, so I want to know if this is normal or if I should file a complaint with support.", "output": "Ride start aagurathukku munnadi app-la fare rendu nooru rupaa maadhiri kaattinalum, ippo driver sollara, surge pricing um indha route-la toll charge um irukkurathunaala, final amount almost double aagum nu, so idhu normal-a illana support-kitta complaint pannanuma nu enakku theriyanum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 24, "english_tokens": 17, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 41, "tamil_ratio": 0.585, "english_ratio": 0.415}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.322226+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please tell the driver that once he crosses the second signal, he should not take the flyover like the app is showing, because there's road construction going on up there, and instead he should continue straight on the service road until he sees a petrol bunk on the right, and take the small lane right after that.", "output": "Driver-kitta sollunga, rendaavadhu signal cross pannadhukku aprom, app kaattura maadhiri flyover-a edukkakoodadhu nu, mela road construction nadakkuthu, adhukku badhila service road-la straight-a po sollunga, right side-la petrol bunk varaikkum po, adha kadanthadhukku aprom irukkura chinna lane-la thirumbunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 26, "english_tokens": 15, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 41, "tamil_ratio": 0.634, "english_ratio": 0.366}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.349898+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I understand that the driver might be new to this area, but this is the third time he's missed the turn even after I explained it clearly, so at this point I think it would be faster if I just share my live location on WhatsApp so he can follow it directly instead of relying on the app's navigation.", "output": "Driver-kku indha area pudhusa irukkalam nu enakku puriyudhu, aana naan clear-a solli kooda idhu moonaavadhu thadava avaru turn miss pannirukaru, so ippo naan WhatsApp-la enoda live location share pannitten na avaru direct-a follow pannalam, app navigation-a nambaama.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 26, "english_tokens": 12, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 38, "tamil_ratio": 0.684, "english_ratio": 0.316}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.393428+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Before you drop me off, could you please wait for exactly two minutes near the gate because I need to run inside and grab a package that I forgot, and I promise it won't take any longer than that since the security guard already has it ready at the front desk.", "output": "Neenga ennai drop pannadhukku munnadi, gate pakkathula rendu nimisham exact-a wait pannunga, naan ulle odi marandha package-a edukkanum, adhu adhukku mela time edukkadhu nu naan promise pannuren, security guard already front desk-la ready-a vachirukaru.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 22, "english_tokens": 13, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 35, "tamil_ratio": 0.629, "english_ratio": 0.371}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.420534+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The reason I'm cancelling this ride is not because of the driver, but because the app charged me twice for the same booking, and until that refund is processed, I don't feel comfortable booking another ride using the same payment method, so I'll wait until customer support responds to my complaint.", "output": "Naan indha ride-a cancel pannuratha karanam driver-a pathi illa, app anda booking-kku rendu thadava charge pannitutu, andha refund process aagura varaikkum, naan andha payment method-a use pannitu vera ride book panna comfortable-a feel pannala, so customer support enoda complaint-ku reply pannura varaikkum naan wait pannuren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["name_missing:i'll"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 27, "english_tokens": 19, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 46, "tamil_ratio": 0.587, "english_ratio": 0.413}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.447184+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Since there are two of us traveling together but only one pickup pin was shared, please make sure the driver waits at the main entrance instead of the side gate, because my friend is coming from the other building and it'll be easier for both of us to meet him at one common point rather than confusing him with two different locations.", "output": "Naanga rendu per kooda poganum aana oru pickup pin thaan share pannirukom, so driver side gate-a vidama main entrance-la wait pannanum nu confirm pannunga, en friend vera building-la irundhu varaaru, so rendu per onnu spot-la avaru kooda meet pannuradhu easy-a irukum, rendu vera location kudutha avaru confuse aaguvaaru.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 32, "english_tokens": 17, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 2, "content_tokens": 49, "tamil_ratio": 0.653, "english_ratio": 0.347}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:32.468297+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please come to the main gate, not the side entrance, since the side gate is locked right now.", "output": "Main gate-ku vaanga, side entrance-ku venaam, ippo side gate lock-a irukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 6, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.462, "english_ratio": 0.538}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.395482+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I am standing right next to the security cabin, wearing a blue shirt, so it should be easy to spot me.", "output": "Naan security cabin pakkathula nikkuren, blue shirt podutu irukken, so enna kandupudikardhu easy-a irukum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.615, "english_ratio": 0.385}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.465943+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The pin you have is slightly off, so please ask the driver to come a little further down the road.", "output": "Neenga vachiruka pin konjam thappa irukku, so driver-a konjam mela road-la vaanga sollunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.769, "english_ratio": 0.231}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.502961+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I'm on the first floor of the mall, so it'll take me two minutes to come down to the parking area.", "output": "Naan mall first floor-la irukken, so parking area-ku varadhukku rendu nimisham aagum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.615, "english_ratio": 0.385}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.549884+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please tell the driver that our building doesn't allow cars inside, so he should wait at the main road.", "output": "Driver-kitta sollunga, enga building-ku ulla vandi anumadhikama, so main road-la wait pannunga sollunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.667, "english_ratio": 0.333}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.619783+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "There are two apartments with almost the same name here, so please double check the block number.", "output": "Inga rendu apartment almost same name-la irukku, so block number-a double check pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": ["mix:tamil_ratio_low:0.39"], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 5, "english_tokens": 8, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.385, "english_ratio": 0.615}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.665381+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I just came out of the metro station, so please tell the driver to wait near exit number two.", "output": "Naan ippo thaan metro station-la irundhu veliye vandhen, so driver-kitta exit number rendu pakkathula wait pannunga nu sollunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 13, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 19, "tamil_ratio": 0.684, "english_ratio": 0.316}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.695006+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The address I entered is my office, but I'm actually waiting near the coffee shop right across the street.", "output": "Naan podra address enoda office thaan, aana naan actual-a andha road-oda opposite-la irukura coffee shop pakkathula wait pannuren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 9, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 20, "tamil_ratio": 0.55, "english_ratio": 0.45}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.734089+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "My phone battery is very low, so if the driver can't reach me by call, please try messaging instead.", "output": "Enoda phone battery romba kammi irukku, so driver call panni reach panna mudiyalana, message pannunga sollunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.6, "english_ratio": 0.4}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.798159+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "It's quite dark near my house, so please tell the driver to flash the headlights once he's close so I can spot the car.", "output": "Enoda veedu pakkathula romba irutta irukku, so driver kitta pakkathula vandhathum headlight flash pannunga sollunga, naan vandi-a kandupudikaren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 14, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 17, "tamil_ratio": 0.824, "english_ratio": 0.176}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.849266+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I still have about ten more minutes of my meeting left, so please ask the driver to wait a little longer.", "output": "Enoda meeting innum pathu nimisham irukku, so driver konjam nera wait pannunga sollunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 12, "tamil_ratio": 0.75, "english_ratio": 0.25}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.901659+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I know I'm taking longer than expected, so please let the driver know I'll add a little extra for the wait time.", "output": "Naan expect pannadha vida nera edukkuren nu enakku theriyum, so wait time-ku konjam extra kudukuren nu driver-kitta sollunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["name_missing:i'll"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 14, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 19, "tamil_ratio": 0.737, "english_ratio": 0.263}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:35.974428+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The doctor hasn't called my number yet, so it might take another fifteen minutes before I come out.", "output": "Doctor innum enoda number call pannala, so veliye varadhukku innum padhinaindhu nimisham aagalam.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 12, "tamil_ratio": 0.75, "english_ratio": 0.25}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.046004+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please don't cancel the ride yet, I'm just finishing up inside and I'll be out in five minutes.", "output": "Ippodhaikku ride cancel pannadheenga, naan ulla vela mudichitu irukken, ainthu nimishathula veliye varen.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_dropped:minutes", "name_missing:i'll"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 2, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.846, "english_ratio": 0.154}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.080275+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The driver has been waiting for a while now, so please hurry up and come down as soon as possible.", "output": "Driver nallaave neram wait pannitu irukaru, so fast-a veliye vaanga mudinjavarai.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 10, "tamil_ratio": 0.7, "english_ratio": 0.3}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.109335+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I got stuck in a long queue at billing, so it'll take a bit more time than I originally told you.", "output": "Naan billing-la neriya queue-la sikkitten, so naan mudhalla sonna time vida konjam nera aagum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 12, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.8, "english_ratio": 0.2}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.138342+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Since the flight got delayed by an hour, please tell the driver he doesn't need to wait right now.", "output": "Flight oru mani neram delay aagirathunaala, driver ippo wait pannanum nu venaam nu sollunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.714, "english_ratio": 0.286}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.184066+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I'm sorry for the delay, my previous meeting overran and I couldn't step out any earlier than this.", "output": "Delay-kku sorry, enoda mudhal meeting nera edithukiduchu, adhukku munnadi naan veliye varamudiyala.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.769, "english_ratio": 0.231}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.234962+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please take the flyover this time instead of the service road, since the service road usually has more traffic.", "output": "Indha thadava service road-a vidama flyover-a edunga, service road-la usually traffic jaasthi irukum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["weak_tanglish"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.5, "english_ratio": 0.5}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.262621+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "After the second traffic signal, please take a right turn and continue until you see a big temple on the left.", "output": "Rendaavadhu traffic signal-kku aprom, right turn edunga, left side-la periya kovil varaikkum po.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.6, "english_ratio": 0.4}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.302759+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "There's a one-way street coming up, so please take the previous left instead of going straight.", "output": "Munnadi oru one-way street varum, so straight-a poganum nu illama adhukku munnadi left edunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_added_minor:arrive"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.643, "english_ratio": 0.357}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.343829+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please don't follow the app's suggestion here, since that road is closed for repair work right now.", "output": "Inga app sollara route-a follow pannadheenga, andha road ippo repair work-ku close pannirukanga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_added_minor:map"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.5, "english_ratio": 0.5}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.384925+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Once you cross the railway bridge, take the second lane on the right, not the first one.", "output": "Railway bridge cross pannadhukku aprom, right side rendaavadhu lane edunga, mudhal lane venaam.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 6, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.462, "english_ratio": 0.538}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.429865+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "This area has a lot of one-way roads, so it might be easier if I guide you turn by turn instead of using the map.", "output": "Indha area-la neriya one-way roads irukku, so map use pannadha vida naan turn by turn guide pannuradhu easy-a irukum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 10, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 2, "content_tokens": 19, "tamil_ratio": 0.474, "english_ratio": 0.526}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.469555+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please slow down near the school zone ahead, since children usually cross the road around this time.", "output": "Munnadi irukura school zone pakkathula slow-a poonga, indha time-la usually kuzhandhaikal road cross pannuvanga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.533, "english_ratio": 0.467}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.505045+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The GPS is showing a shortcut through the narrow lane, but that road is too small for this car to pass.", "output": "GPS chinna lane-la shortcut kaattutu irukku, aana andha road indha vandi pogura alavukku chinnadhu.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.667, "english_ratio": 0.333}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.536269+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please continue straight past the bus stop, and I'll tell you exactly where to turn once we get closer.", "output": "Bus stop-a thaandi straight-a po, naanga pakkathula vandhadhum exact-a enga thirumbanum nu solren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["name_missing:i'll"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.692, "english_ratio": 0.308}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.562551+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Instead of turning at the roundabout, please take the road just before it that leads directly to my street.", "output": "Roundabout-la thirumbadha, adhukku munnadi irukura road-a edunga, adhu direct-a enoda street-ku poidum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.786, "english_ratio": 0.214}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.584867+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please drop me right in front of the pharmacy, not near the bus stop, since I need to pick up a prescription.", "output": "Bus stop pakkathula illama, pharmacy munnadi thaan drop pannunga, naan prescription vaanganum.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 12, "tamil_ratio": 0.583, "english_ratio": 0.417}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.609191+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "This is not the correct building, my apartment complex is the next one, about two hundred meters ahead.", "output": "Idhu correct building illa, enoda apartment complex adutha onnu, rendu nooru meter mela irukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.643, "english_ratio": 0.357}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.653728+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please stop the car here itself, I can walk the rest of the way since the road ahead is very narrow.", "output": "Inga thaan vandi-a nikathunga, munnadi road romba narrow-a irukurathunaala baaki naan nadanthu poiduven.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 2, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.846, "english_ratio": 0.154}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.677499+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Could you drop me at the back entrance instead of the front, since the front gate is currently closed for renovation?", "output": "Front-a vidama back entrance-la drop pannalama, front gate renovation-ku ippo close pannirukanga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": ["mix:tamil_ratio_low:0.43"], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 6, "english_tokens": 8, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.429, "english_ratio": 0.571}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.697645+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please wait for just a moment after dropping me, in case I need to come back for something I forgot.", "output": "Drop pannadhukku aprom konja neram wait pannunga, naan edho marandhadha thirumba vara vendi irundha.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 12, "english_tokens": 2, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.857, "english_ratio": 0.143}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.734378+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "This is my stop, but please pull over a little further since there's a car parked right in front of the gate.", "output": "Idhu enoda stop, aana konjam mela po, gate munnadi oru vandi park pannirukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.692, "english_ratio": 0.308}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.769372+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please be careful while dropping me here since the road has a small pothole right next to the curb.", "output": "Inga drop pannumbodhu konjam careful-a irukanga, curb pakkathula oru chinna pothole irukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_dropped:road"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 12, "tamil_ratio": 0.667, "english_ratio": 0.333}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.817274+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I need to be dropped exactly at gate number three, since the other gates don't allow visitor entry after six.", "output": "Naan exact-a gate number moonu-la drop aaganum, vera gate-la aaru mani-kku aprom visitor entry kidaiyathu.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_added_minor:hours"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 18, "tamil_ratio": 0.611, "english_ratio": 0.389}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.864005+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Could you confirm whether the fare shown in the app already includes the toll charges for this route?", "output": "App-la kaattura fare-la indha route-oda toll charge already add pannirukanga nu confirm pannalama?", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 8, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 16, "tamil_ratio": 0.5, "english_ratio": 0.5}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.922422+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I'd prefer to pay by UPI instead of cash, so please make sure the driver has a scanner code ready.", "output": "Naan cash-a vida UPI-la pay pannuradha prefer pannuren, so driver kitta scanner code ready-a vachirukanga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 8, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.467, "english_ratio": 0.533}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:36.976979+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The final fare seems higher than what was quoted at the start, so could you explain why the difference happened?", "output": "Final fare start-la sonnadha vida jaasthi maadhiri irukku, so idhu yeppadi difference vandhuchu nu explain pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 16, "tamil_ratio": 0.688, "english_ratio": 0.312}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.001636+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I don't have exact change right now, so is it possible to round off the fare to the nearest ten rupees?", "output": "Ippodhaikku enakku exact change illa, so fare-a adutha pathu rupaa-ku round off pannalama?", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.615, "english_ratio": 0.385}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.029794+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Since the ride included a toll crossing, please add that amount separately instead of clubbing it with the base fare.", "output": "Ride-la toll crossing irundhadhunaala, andha amount-a base fare kooda clubbing pannadha, separate-a add pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 8, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.467, "english_ratio": 0.533}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.057437+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I noticed I was charged twice for the same trip, so could you please look into this and process a refund?", "output": "Naan same trip-ku rendu thadava charge aana maadhiri paakuren, so idha paathu refund process pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.6, "english_ratio": 0.4}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.092692+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Is there any additional charge for waiting time, or is that already included in the total fare shown?", "output": "Wait time-ku edhavadhu extra charge irukka, illana adhu already total fare-la include aayirukka?", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.533, "english_ratio": 0.467}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.154463+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Could you send me the receipt over email as well, since I need it for reimbursement from my office?", "output": "Receipt-a email-lakum anupungala, enakku office-la reimbursement-ku vendiyathu.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 6, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 10, "tamil_ratio": 0.6, "english_ratio": 0.4}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.209745+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The driver took a much longer route than necessary, and I don't think that was intentional but I'd like it noted.", "output": "Driver venumaana route vida romba nera route edutharu, adhu intentional-a nenaikkala aana idha note pannanum nu solren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["name_missing:i'd"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 12, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 17, "tamil_ratio": 0.706, "english_ratio": 0.294}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.240819+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I felt the driver was on the phone for most of the ride, which made me a little uncomfortable given the traffic.", "output": "Driver ride full time-la phone-la pesikitu irundhaaru maadhiri thonuchu, traffic-la irundhathunaala enakku konjam uncomfortable-a irundhuchu.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 18, "tamil_ratio": 0.611, "english_ratio": 0.389}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.269836+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The car had a strong smell of cigarette smoke, so I'd like to request a cleaner vehicle for future rides.", "output": "Vandi-la cigarette smoke smell romba strong-a irundhuchu, so future ride-ku clean-a irukura vandi venum nu request pannuren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["name_missing:i'd"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 18, "tamil_ratio": 0.611, "english_ratio": 0.389}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.307425+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The driver refused to switch on the AC even though it was requested, and I'd like this to be looked into.", "output": "Request pannirundhalum driver AC podama irunthaaru, so idha paathukanum nu solren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["name_missing:i'd"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 3, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 10, "tamil_ratio": 0.7, "english_ratio": 0.3}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.344840+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I was charged for a cancellation even though I cancelled well within the free cancellation window shown in the app.", "output": "App-la kaattura free cancellation window-kulla cancel pannirundhalum, enakku cancellation charge podirukanga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 6, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.462, "english_ratio": 0.538}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.361426+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The driver arrived nearly twenty minutes late without any prior notification, which caused me to miss my appointment.", "output": "Driver munnadi edhuvum sollama almost irubathu nimisham late-a vandhaaru, adhunaala enoda appointment miss aayiduchu.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_dropped:arrive"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.643, "english_ratio": 0.357}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.385647+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The vehicle that arrived didn't match the number plate shown in the app, so I was initially hesitant to board.", "output": "Vandha vandi-oda number plate app-la kaattura number plate-oda match aagala, so mudhalla naan erika hesitate pannen.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["concept_dropped:arrive"], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 12, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 18, "tamil_ratio": 0.667, "english_ratio": 0.333}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.407712+00:00"}
