{"engine": "gold", "source": "There's a huge traffic jam near the flyover because of an accident, so it might take an extra twenty minutes.", "output": "Flyover pakkathula accident irundhadhunaala periya traffic jam irukku, so extra irubathu nimisham aagalam.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 12, "tamil_ratio": 0.583, "english_ratio": 0.417}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.509800+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Since there's a VIP movement expected on the main road, it might be better to take the bypass route instead.", "output": "Main road-la VIP movement irukum nu expect pannuvanga, so adhukku badhila bypass route edukurathu nallaadhu.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.533, "english_ratio": 0.467}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.546909+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The signal near the junction has been down for a while, so traffic is being managed manually and moving slowly.", "output": "Junction pakkathula signal konja neramaaga work aagala, so traffic manual-a manage panniyum slow-a poitu irukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.643, "english_ratio": 0.357}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.603241+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Because of the ongoing metro construction work, this stretch of road has been reduced to a single lane.", "output": "Metro construction work nadakkurathunaala, indha road stretch single lane-a reduce aayirukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": ["weak_tanglish"], "mix_flags": ["mix:tamil_ratio_low:0.36"], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 4, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 11, "tamil_ratio": 0.364, "english_ratio": 0.636}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.646672+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "There seems to be a protest happening near the college, so a few roads in that area are currently blocked.", "output": "College pakkathula protest nadakkura maadhiri irukku, so andha area-la konjam roads block aayirukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.615, "english_ratio": 0.385}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.708481+00:00"}
