{"engine": "gold", "source": "My friend will also be joining midway, so please stop near the bus stand after the second signal.", "output": "Enoda friend kooda naduvula erikuvaru, so rendaavadhu signal-kku aprom bus stand pakkathula nikkunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.692, "english_ratio": 0.308}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.872035+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Since this is a shared ride, please confirm if the other passenger is being picked up before or after me.", "output": "Idhu shared ride-nala, vera passenger-a enakku munnadiya illana pinnadiya pick pannuvanga nu confirm pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.667, "english_ratio": 0.333}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.900614+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "We have two drop points on this trip, so please drop me first since my location is closer.", "output": "Indha trip-la rendu drop point irukku, enoda location pakkathula irukurathunaala enna mudhalla drop pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.667, "english_ratio": 0.333}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.928243+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Could you wait for two minutes at the ATM, I just need to withdraw some cash before we continue.", "output": "ATM-la rendu nimisham wait pannalama, naan konjam cash edukanum, appuram continue pannalam.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 9, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 13, "tamil_ratio": 0.692, "english_ratio": 0.308}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.969463+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please make sure the child lock is on for the back seat since I have a toddler traveling with me.", "output": "Back seat-la child lock on-a irukanum, enakooda oru chinna kuzhandhai varudhu.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 7, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 11, "tamil_ratio": 0.636, "english_ratio": 0.364}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:37.997102+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Could you drive a little more carefully around the speed bumps, since I'm feeling a bit motion sick today.", "output": "Speed bump pakkathula konjam careful-a drive pannunga, enakku indha naeku konjam motion sickness maadhiri irukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.733, "english_ratio": 0.267}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.049543+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Please avoid using the phone while driving, it makes me a little nervous especially in this traffic.", "output": "Drive pannumbodhu phone use pannadheenga, adhu enna konjam nervous-a pannuthu, especially indha traffic-la.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.571, "english_ratio": 0.429}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.125367+00:00"}
