{"engine": "gold", "source": "I need to cancel this ride since my plans changed suddenly, I hope there's no cancellation charge this time.", "output": "Enoda plans suddenly change aanadhunaala indha ride-a cancel pannanum, indha thadava cancellation charge illama irukum nu nenaikuren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 7, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 17, "tamil_ratio": 0.588, "english_ratio": 0.412}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.292896+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "The driver isn't moving on the map at all, so I think I should cancel and book a new ride instead.", "output": "Driver map-la ippadiye nikkuraru, so naan cancel pannitu vera oru ride book pannuradhu nallaadhu nu nenaikuren.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 16, "tamil_ratio": 0.688, "english_ratio": 0.312}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.309871+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "Could you please rebook the ride with a different driver, since this one seems to be stuck somewhere far away.", "output": "Vera driver-a vachu ride-a rebook pannalama, indha driver romba dhooram edho stuck aayirukura maadhiri irukku.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 15, "tamil_ratio": 0.667, "english_ratio": 0.333}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.329027+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "I accidentally booked the wrong pickup location, so could you help me cancel this without any penalty?", "output": "Naan thappa vera pickup location book pannitten, so idha penalty illama cancel panna help pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 8, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.571, "english_ratio": 0.429}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.360377+00:00"}
