{"engine": "gold", "source": "The driver called and asked me to cancel from my end because of some issue with his vehicle.", "output": "Driver call pannitu, vandi-la edho issue irukku so enoda side-la irundhu cancel pannunga nu kettaru.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 11, "english_tokens": 5, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 16, "tamil_ratio": 0.688, "english_ratio": 0.312}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.421740+00:00"}
