{"engine": "gold", "source": "Since the road is completely flooded near the underpass, could you take an alternate route to avoid it?", "output": "Underpass pakkathula road completely flood aayirukurathunaala, adha avoid panna alternate route edunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 6, "english_tokens": 6, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 12, "tamil_ratio": 0.5, "english_ratio": 0.5}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.876725+00:00"}
{"engine": "gold", "source": "This is somewhat urgent since I have a flight to catch in an hour, so please try to take the fastest route possible.", "output": "Idhu konjam urgent, oru mani neram-la enakku flight irukku, so mudinjavarai fastest route-a edunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 10, "english_tokens": 4, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 1, "content_tokens": 14, "tamil_ratio": 0.714, "english_ratio": 0.286}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:38.919332+00:00"}
