{"engine": "gold", "source": "I'm currently standing near the security gate outside the apartment complex, but since there are two entrances on this road, please ask the driver to confirm which side he's coming from before he gets confused and goes to the wrong gate.", "output": "Naan ipo apartment complex veliye security gate pakkathula nikkuren, aana indha road-la rendu entrance irukkurathunala, driver confuse aagi thappu gate-ku poaradhukku munnadi, avaru eppadi vara pora nu confirm pannunga.", "meaning_ok": true, "hard_flags": [], "soft_flags": [], "mix_flags": [], "mix": {"tamil_tokens": 21, "english_tokens": 10, "unknown_tokens": 0, "function_tokens": 0, "content_tokens": 31, "tamil_ratio": 0.677, "english_ratio": 0.323}, "ok": true, "ts": "2026-08-29T19:23:51.038501+00:00"}
